  "changelog": "**Agent Memory 12.2.0 \u2013 Major update with enhanced documentation, security, and OpenClaw integration**\n\n- Refactored documentation system: added ARCHITECTURE.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, SECURITY.md, UPGRADE_PLAN.md, and extensive internal docs.\n- CLI migration: all commands now use `cli.py` with adjusted instructions for OpenClaw skill directory usage.\n- Credentials expanded: now supports granular read/write API keys, new LLM/embedding backend options, and improved configuration guidance.\n- Added explicit permissions section with risk assessment for sensitive operations and optional external integrations.\n- Many legacy and example files removed or archived to streamline the codebase.\n- Numerous security, compliance, and operational improvements reflected in updated instructions and environment variable handling.",
